    "detailed_description": "WASDJK is a maze adventure game, but you won't be able to see the maze scenes like in regular games, and only have chaotic operation hints to guide your path.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game controls: </h2>From the game name, it can be seen that the game will use WASDJK operation. If you choose to use a controller, the direction control will use the cross key operation, but it will not replace the display of WASD operation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953790/extras/f26b69fe7eb8c99ea955507aa572ba24.avif?t=1718809278\" width=512 height=256 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game mode: </h2>-Stage Mode: The basic plot flow allows you to cross traps, challenge strong enemies, and face the final showdown during this maze journey.<br>-Endless Mode: Unlocked after passing through the Stage Mode, there is 2 different types of survival racing challenges.",
